# Cast — unaligned
#
# Props and figures that belong to no faction: the Recycle Bin that wipes
# your record, the Search Oracle that autocompletes your fate, the
# Profile Mirror that shows you to yourself, and the Banned — a ghost
# nobody could log out.

# Prop: drag your sins in here. The way to survive an angry Algorithm.
CHARACTER Recycle_Bin
  on scan guest
    -> clear_history

# Prop: ask, and it autocompletes your fate (read-only lore + hints).
CHARACTER Search_Oracle
  on scan guest
    -> ask_oracle

# Prop: a mirror that resolves into your live profile.
CHARACTER Profile_Mirror
  on scan guest
    -> check_profile

# Named figure: a permabanned ghost behind the glass.
CHARACTER The_Banned
  on scan guest
    -> banned_ghost
